[{"title":"Hello World","url":"/2026/06/27/Hello-World-0/","content":"Welcome to my new blog! 🚀\nThis is the first post on my Hexo-powered GitHub Pages site.\nStay tuned for more content coming soon.\n"},{"title":"C++ 速记：提取整数时别漏掉字符串结束符","url":"/2026/09/28/cpp-parse-integers-string-terminator/","content":"从字符数组中逐位提取整数时：\nwhile (i &lt; 20 &amp;&amp; strnum[i] != &#x27; &#x27;)  // 仍会处理 &#x27;\\0&#x27;\n\n&#39;\\0&#39; 不是空格。把它当数字处理会得到：\n382 * 10 + (&#x27;\\0&#x27; - &#x27;0&#x27;)= 3820 - 48= 3772\n\n正确条件：\nwhile (i &lt; 20 &amp;&amp; strnum[i] != &#x27; &#x27; &amp;&amp; strnum[i] != &#x27;\\0&#x27;) &#123;    sz[j] = sz[j] * 10 + strnum[i] - &#x27;0&#x27;;    ++i;&#125;\n\ni &lt; 20 防止越界，strnum[i] != &#39;\\0&#39; 防止处理结束符。范围判断放最前面，利用 &amp;&amp; 短路求值避免越界访问。\n","categories":["编程学习"],"tags":["C++"]},{"title":"C++ 速记：memcpy 的长度单位是字节","url":"/2026/09/28/cpp-memcpy-copies-bytes/","content":"memcpy 的第三个参数是字节数，不是元素个数。\nmemcpy(b, a, 10);  // 错：只复制 10 bytes\n\n常见环境中 int 占 4 bytes，因此这不等于复制 10 个 int。出现 1 2 3 0 0... 与内存布局及小端存储有关，不应依赖。\nmemcpy(b, a, sizeof(a));  // 复制整个数组\n\n记忆：memcpy(目标, 来源, 字节数)。\n","categories":["编程学习"],"tags":["C++"]},{"title":"C++ 速记：scanf 与无临时变量交换","url":"/2026/09/21/cpp-scanf-and-in-place-swap/","content":"1. scanf 输入普通变量要加 &amp;int x;scanf(&quot;%d&quot;, &amp;x);\n\nscanf 需要变量的地址。\n2. scanf 不能直接读取 stringchar s[100];scanf(&quot;%99s&quot;, s);  // 数组名本身就是地址，不加 &amp;\n\nstd::string 使用 cin &gt;&gt; s。\n3. 不用临时变量交换两个整数a = a + b;b = a - b;a = a - b;\n\n常见环境中两个 int 共 8 bytes，无需额外变量；加法可能溢出，实际代码优先使用 swap(a, b)。\n","categories":["编程学习"],"tags":["C++"]},{"title":"第一次前进","url":"/2026/09/28/%E7%AC%AC%E4%B8%80%E6%AC%A1%E5%89%8D%E8%BF%9B/","content":"\n\n  \n  \n    \n      \n      \n        这是一篇私密文章，请输入访问密码。\n      \n    \n  \n\n\n\nimport {initHBE} from \"/js/plugins/hbe.js\";\n  log.info(ensurePrefix(\"hexo-blog-encrypt: loaded.\"));\n    initHBE();\n\n","categories":["生活随笔"],"tags":["随笔","生活"]},{"title":"初遇","url":"/2026/09/22/%E5%88%9D%E9%81%87/","content":"\n\n  \n  \n    \n      \n      \n        这是一篇私密文章，请输入访问密码。\n      \n    \n  \n\n\n\nimport {initHBE} from \"/js/plugins/hbe.js\";\n  log.info(ensurePrefix(\"hexo-blog-encrypt: loaded.\"));\n    initHBE();\n\n","categories":["生活随笔"],"tags":["随笔","相遇","心情"]},{"title":"C++ 中读取以 0 结束的一串整数：三种 while 写法","url":"/2026/09/21/cpp-read-integers-until-zero/","content":"输入一串整数，以 0 结束（0 不参与处理）。\n1. while 条件中读入（推荐）int x;while (cin &gt;&gt; x &amp;&amp; x != 0) &#123;    // 处理 x&#125;\n\n2. while + breakint x;while (true) &#123;    if (!(cin &gt;&gt; x) || x == 0) break;    // 处理 x&#125;\n\n3. do…whileint x;do &#123;    cin &gt;&gt; x;    if (x != 0) &#123;        // 处理 x    &#125;&#125; while (x != 0);\n\n选择：一般用 1；退出条件复杂时用 2；必须先执行一次时用 3。\n","categories":["编程学习"],"tags":["C++","循环"]},{"title":"Hello World","url":"/2026/06/27/hello-world/","content":"Welcome to Hexo! This is your very first post. Check documentation for more info. If you get any problems when using Hexo, you can find the answer in troubleshooting or you can ask me on GitHub.\nQuick StartCreate a new post$ hexo new &quot;My New Post&quot;\n\nMore info: Writing\nRun server$ hexo server\n\nMore info: Server\nGenerate static files$ hexo generate\n\nMore info: Generating\nDeploy to remote sites$ hexo deploy\n\nMore info: Deployment\n"}]